WEBVTT

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:17.000
Tencent Video presents

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:29.920
Adapted from the bestseller The King's Avatar
by Butterfly Blue

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:32.270
Copyright Notice
All rights preserved by China Literature

00:00:56.100 --> 00:01:00.810
♪ The dawn piercing horn is being played by now ♪

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.930
♪ Is that a fantasy or just past memories? ♪

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:08.470
♪ Eyes wide open, but I can't tell ♪

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:12.430
♪ which side of the road am I running on ♪

00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:19.810
♪ Would I know the memories and breaks mixed in morning light? ♪

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:23.180
♪ They said you shouldn't march on ♪

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:25.680
♪ They said you have to say goodbye ♪

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:30.180
♪ They say you can have no tomorrow but dark night ♪

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:32.810
♪ Over the finish line ♪

00:01:32.810 --> 00:01:35.310
♪ I will restart my dream again ♪

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:37.100
♪ Even if it's dangerous ♪

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:42.310
♪ I will keep marching and get my crown back ♪

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:45.720
♪ Put on my armor and step to the unknown future ♪

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:50.890
♪ Hold on to my light on the road together with you ♪

00:01:50.890 --> 00:01:51.970
♪ becomes the power that supports me ♪

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:55.560
♪ The morning light that burns in my heart ♪

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:57.930
♪ will blossom at dawn ♪

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:00.640
♪ Dawn of Glory on battlefield ♪

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:03.890
♪ I will show you my edge ♪

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:12.430
<b>Champion Heart</b>

00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:16.200
(Level 70 Hundred-player Dungeon - Tomb in the Sky)

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:18.870
We have a new guy here.

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:22.000
Welcome to Tyrannical Ambition's 4th branch.

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:24.580
I assume you're an MT Knight base on your gadgets.

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:26.000
Check out his ID.

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:28.410
That's a cocky name.

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:29.700
Unrivaled Super Hottie.

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:31.580
Yeah.

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:32.790
I'm an Main Tank Knight.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:34.140
Hi there.

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:40.850
Captain, you want to see me?

00:02:40.850 --> 00:02:41.720
Got orders for me?

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:44.830
I heard your branch's doing great on dungeon records.

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:46.700
Got some new talents?

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:47.900
Yes.

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:50.120
We recruited a Knight called Unrivaled Super Hottie.

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:51.790
Cocky name.

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:53.750
But he is incredible as an MT.

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:55.680
Main Tank?

00:02:56.580 --> 00:03:00.120
He was first discovered in guild
Exterminate the Heavens backed by Tyranny.

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:05.450
First day he was in a raggedy outfit,
yet helped us to get the Hundred-player dungeon.

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:07.750
He can do the Arc Charge.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:08.580
And he masters how to fight in water.

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:12.950
If we weren't so inexperienced, maybe
we could already break the dungeon record.

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:16.160
How good do you think he is?

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:20.410
I think, he's better than our No.1 Knight Flight.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:21.830
This guy...

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:22.920
What?

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:25.830
Bring him over the next time you fight the boss.

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:27.450
I want to see him for myself.

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:31.970
(Heavenly Domain, Town)

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:44.600
Sorry for the wait.

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:47.950
That's quite a scene you've got there.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:48.580
What?

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:51.410
The president of Tyrannical
Ambition came to welcome you.

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:51.870
Hello.

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:53.080
Did he recognize you?

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:54.370
I don't think so.

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:55.910
You can trust my undercover skills.

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:56.910
President.

00:03:56.910 --> 00:04:00.410
This is the Knight just joined
our branch, Unrivaled Super Hottie.

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:02.580
Nice to meet you.

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:04.750
I heard you're great at what you do.

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:06.790
It's nice to finally meet.

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:11.080
What you heard is 100% true.

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:14.370
Sure, of course.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:18.040
The Boss at Keen Blade Canyon,
Keen Bladesman Lang Rui has popped.

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.500
We're on our way there.

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:22.450
While you're here, why don't you join us?

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:23.950
Sure.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:26.000
Taking down the boss, that's what I do best.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:27.540
Seriously?

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:28.500
The boss?

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:32.540
The rarest in current game, the most
difficult to get, Level 70 Wild Boss?

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:35.600
For others go undercover, it'll take them
three years and another three years.

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:37.540
This guy's only been under for two days.

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:40.540
He already got into the elite team to fight the boss?

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:43.400
Without further ado, let's get going.

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:49.270
Level 70 Wild Boss: Lang Rui

00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:51.890
(Level 70, Leveling Area - Keen Blade Canyon)

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:58.150
(Blooming Blossom, president of Blossom Valley)

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:00.850
(Three Realms Six Paths, president of Samsara)

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:04.040
Tyranny's running out of players?

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:05.660
They let a rookie take the lead.

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:07.620
Look at his crappy outfit.

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:10.290
And that ID, Unrivaled Super Hottie.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:11.620
This guy...

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:12.660
Standing at the very front.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:13.920
He's supposed to be low-key.

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:15.240
Me?

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:17.540
I'm just passing by.

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:18.660
I figured something is going on here.

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:19.580
I'm just here to help.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:22.830
This guy is a big bragger.

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:25.080
Is he trying to hide his identity?

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:26.580
Is he a professional player?

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:28.250
The Knight in Tyranny...

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:29.750
Zheng Chengfeng?

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:33.370
What are you doing?

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.000
Don't you make random moves.

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:36.620
Take it easy.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:38.370
I just want to see where the boss is.

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:40.080
I couldn't see back there.

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:43.750
Did you not hear me?

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:45.160
What?

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:46.410
I can't even take a look?

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:49.500
Bro, go steal the Boss.

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:50.500
Can you do that?

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:51.750
I'll give it a try.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.200
Good.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.580
We'll do everything we can to cover for you.

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:56.950
Oh, no!

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:58.290
Tyranny's going for the Boss!

00:05:58.290 --> 00:05:58.910
Come on!

00:05:58.910 --> 00:05:59.500
Keep up with them!

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:04.910
Damn it!

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:06.700
Tyranny got to it first.

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:07.500
Well done.

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:10.350
Clerics, Supports, go back him up.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:15.660
Back up that Knight.

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:23.870
Our Clerics got aced?

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:25.290
Who's this Spitfire?

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:27.120
The ID is Dazzling Spring.

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:28.700
Never heard of him.

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:32.330
Blossom Valley, support Dazzling Spring!

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:33.370
Take back the boss!

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:03.330
Damn it.

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:04.750
Who the hell is that Spitfire?

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:12.000
Arc Charge.

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:25.910
That's a nice Aerial Curve.

00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:27.000
But it's just not enough.

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:28.950
Heroic Leap in the air?

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:31.790
Are you kidding me? How can he do that in the air?

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:32.950
What is that? How can he do that?

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:33.790
In the air, for real?

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:34.620
Who are you?

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:36.120
Unrivaled Super Hottie.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:00.830
These two...

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.830
Who the hell are they?

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.450
That's a hell of a fight.

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:12.700
Wait, these familiar moves...

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:15.180
(Glory 5th Season, Arena)

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:18.410
Dazzling Hundred Blossoms launched
a fierce attack on One Autumn Leaf.

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:23.580
This flamboyant style of fast-paced combo
is the signature of Hundred Blossoms' Captain Zhang Jiale.

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:27.700
Is this the Hundred Blossoms style?

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:29.540
This is our captain!

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:31.050
Cap!

00:08:31.420 --> 00:08:34.830
Blossom Valley really went all-in with this Boss.

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:36.410
You're watching movie or what?

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.120
ATs, come take over here!

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:39.160
Go!

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:43.700
Like you can outnumber us.

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:44.660
We're in, too.

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:45.370
Kill those in our way!

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:46.200
Let's go, boys!

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:47.040
Get the aggro!

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:48.000
Get out of my way!

00:08:48.330 --> 00:08:50.080
Samsara is not here for fun.

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:53.660
Over my dead body!

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:55.040
Bring it on!

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:56.450
Tyrannical Ambition always wins!

00:08:58.410 --> 00:09:01.620
Judging from my HP, I won't last long.
(Unrivaled Super Hottie)

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:03.870
Closest Cleric to me on the team is...

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:13.620
Captain!

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:15.620
It's our captain!

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:16.750
Captain's back.

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:17.750
Captain Zhang Jiale.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:20.000
Captain!

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:21.300
(From Unrivaled Super Hottie)

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:22.630
Cleric, Revive me!

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:31.950
I know it's fun to go smurfing.

00:09:32.290 --> 00:09:34.290
But do you really have to get your
sense of superiority here, like this?

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:36.200
You're not that bad, man.

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:38.700
Who the hell are you?

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:40.540
Heal, please?

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:42.080
Cleric, can't you see my health?

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:45.950
Thanks, girl.

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:46.870
Nice moves.

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:48.250
You're welcome.

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:50.620
If you need, I can take two more Clerics with you.

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:53.250
You a man?

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:55.250
Don't run.

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:56.830
Let me kick your ass.

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:59.830
You really think you're gonna
be almighty in this online game?

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.250
Get rid of the Cleric if you're a man!

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.200
Cleric, protect yourself.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:10.620
Why are you running?

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:11.910
Give yourself a Heal.

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:13.410
You don't really think he can <i>Instant Kill</i> you, do you?

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:18.910
Well, he just <i>Instant Killed</i> a Cleric.

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:37.870
Captain Jiale, come on!

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:38.580
Take him down.

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:39.410
We got your back!

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:50.900
The King's Avatar 2

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:56.080
You went undercover in Tyranny to recruit him?

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:57.130
Who?

00:10:57.950 --> 00:10:59.160
Master Zhang Jiale!

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:03.660
So I went undercover in Tyranny
for the former captain of Hundred Blossoms.

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:06.290
What's the logic in it?

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:09.150
You're not?

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:10.660
Of course no.

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:12.200
It's a coincidence.

00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:16.580
If I knew I would bump into him with my current
crappy equipments, I'm going to get myself killed.

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:20.290
So what you're saying is you're no match for him now.

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:22.370
I've already died once.

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:23.870
Didn't you see it?

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:28.290
I-I thought that was another one of your cheap plays.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:29.870
There's no such play.

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:32.290
Getting killed will cost me tributes.

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:34.700
Any Cleric out there?

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:36.200
My health's running low.

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:39.500
Kill him!

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:41.200
Go, Captain Zhang Jiale!

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:42.580
Kill him!

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:44.250
Don't let Samsara get the aggro.

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:46.870
We Tyranny will definitely get this Boss.

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:50.910
Those people from Blossom Valley don't even care the Boss?

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:54.400
Take down the Boss while we don't have many opponents.

00:11:56.790 --> 00:11:58.750
I mean, why so serious?

00:11:59.160 --> 00:12:01.450
You can go smurf at some other places.

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:03.040
Just pretend you're breaking up.

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:06.040
You don't seem very relaxed either.

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:07.250
Of course not.

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:09.700
I want to get my own team and back to the League.

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:11.000
Of course I have to be serious.

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:12.450
So it's you.

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:17.000
You said I shouldn't look for sense of superiority in smurfing.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.500
Well, I guess I can get it from you then.

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:26.330
How many tributes he got from the equipments?

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:28.160
I wish I had backup.

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:31.120
I got your back.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:32.410
Perfect timing.

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:33.290
Thank you.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:34.580
Come on.

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:35.950
Let's see who is the supreme one?

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:39.830
Your HP did not drop a thing.

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:40.580
Is that really fun?

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:43.660
Let's see whose Cleric will run out of MP first.

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:45.000
Boring.

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:46.290
Why do you keep running?

00:12:46.580 --> 00:12:48.330
Don't just give up on yourself.

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:50.450
When I'm done with the Boss, I'll then get back to you.

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:02.660
Why do you always have to be that difficult?

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.700
Because I don't ever give up.

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:09.830
You've had it all.

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:11.290
Why can't you just let go?

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:15.500
I've never heard anyone can
have enough of the championship.

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:18.160
Champion?

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:25.200
Halfway through Glory's second regular season,
the newly-joined Hundred Blossoms is on the run.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:27.160
It's been leading on the table.

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:33.330
Their dual-play based on Berserker Blossoming Chaos
and Spitfire Dazzling Hundred Blossoms is amazing.

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:37.410
Some critics even go like,
the League will now enter the Dual Era.

00:13:39.370 --> 00:13:40.450
Congratulations to Excellent Era.

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:44.330
It's a pity, Hundred Blossoms, seeded team in season three,

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:46.450
has lost to Excellent Era, earning a second place.

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:48.290
Looking forward to their future performances.

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:51.370
Sun Zeping retired from hand injury in season five.
(Captain Sun Zeping retired, Zhang Jiale took the lead)

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:53.370
Zhang Jiale has taken over as captain.

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:55.580
Brushed against the championship again.

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:58.200
Congratulations to Hundred Blossoms on another runner-up.
(Tiny Herb won the finals in season five)

00:13:58.200 --> 00:13:59.660
Make sure to keep it going next year.

00:13:59.660 --> 00:14:02.870
Dual now turns into single, they're done.

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:06.080
Haven't you heard the expression, nice, but it's a miss.

00:14:06.750 --> 00:14:11.290
Once again, Hundred Blossoms made it to the finals
with the lead of Zhang Jiale in season seven.

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:12.900
Can they pull it off this time?

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:16.450
No, Hundred Blossoms is in a tough spot right now.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.540
Oh, no.

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:20.370
It's a real pity.
(Tiny Herb on a continuous win)

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:21.700
You were great this year.
(Hundred Blossoms lost to Tiny Herb, another runner-up)

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:22.700
All you're missing is that tiny bit of luck.

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:28.330
Zhang Jiale is a very capable player,
but somehow things don't work out for him.

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:29.120
Yeah.

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:30.120
It's such a pity.

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:34.360
I'm tired.

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:36.330
I decide to retire.

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:49.790
Winning the championship can be addictive.

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:53.000
I actually kind of miss it.

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:57.870
I don't feel like I'm ready to quit at all.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:02.160
As long as there's the slightest hope, I'll never give up.

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:05.000
Even for just one more day.

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:09.700
Man, you are currently retired, okay?

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:13.250
We don't have to limit ourselves to the Pro Leagues.

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:14.290
Here is also Glory.

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:17.700
This is where we started in the first place.

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:22.120
What are you waiting for?

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:23.450
Kill him.

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:26.700
Come on!

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:27.620
Protect Captain Zhang!

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:29.370
Blossom Valley's coming.

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:30.620
Go!

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:33.120
Let's go!

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:33.750
I'm gonna slay y'all!

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:35.250
Don't you look down on Tyranny!

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:36.950
All right, all right.

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:37.950
He's dead.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.330
You guys need to get out of here.

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:41.450
The priority right now is to get the Boss.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:42.950
Let's go, boys!

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:44.830
Revenge for our captain!

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:47.330
Why can't they just chill?

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:50.790
Bro, the Boss got surrounded by the elites of Blossom Valley.

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:51.620
We need help.

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:52.830
Didn't expect them to be that cocky.

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:53.950
I'll get it back.

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:55.700
Knights and Clerics, come with me.

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:58.080
Boys, let's go.

00:15:58.080 --> 00:15:58.910
Alright.

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:00.790
I'm gonna go Sacrificial Roar.

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:03.080
All Clerics go with Cure on my HP.

00:16:03.950 --> 00:16:05.410
Here comes Tyrannical Ambition!

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:06.200
Look out.

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:08.540
Take this fireball.

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:09.410
Soul Arrow!

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:11.410
The Cure!

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:31.200
He <i>Instant-Killed</i> all of them.

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:32.080
How's that possible?

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:33.080
What the heck?

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:33.940
He cheating!

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:34.820
You've gotta be kidding me.

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:36.950
He's so good.

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:38.040
This guy...

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:39.450
Who the hell is he?

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:41.000
Maelstrom Counterattack?

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:44.830
He aced the Blossom Valley with only one skill.

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:46.160
Is that even possible?

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:47.620
How the hell did he do that?

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:52.080
Maybe he went like this.

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:55.660
First he used Sacrificial Roar to draw
all the attacks from Blossom Valley.

00:16:56.250 --> 00:17:01.500
And then he went with Maelstrom Counterattack,
reflected all the damages he got in one hit.

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:05.290
We're talking about all the attacks
from Blossom Valley, of course they'll be aced.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:08.370
While absorbing the attacks, Unrivaled Super Hottie survived

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:11.500
because he got all those Cures from all the Clerics.

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:13.620
Is that even possible?

00:17:13.620 --> 00:17:14.910
Yeah, theoretically.

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:18.700
But even knowing how it works,
it's still gonna be very difficult to achieve.

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:22.540
There is no way we can make it happen for now.

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:25.120
Are you Knights done with the cool-down?

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:26.300
Stay in order.

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:27.750
Attack when I tell you to.

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:28.370
Alright.

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:29.080
Be on it.

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:30.950
President.

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:32.790
Our entire elite team got aced.

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:33.750
What now?

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:34.820
Let's get out of here.

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:42.370
President.

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:44.000
Who the hell is this dude?

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:46.580
What do you think?

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:50.620
Besides Ye Qiu, no one can be this good in this game.

00:17:51.410 --> 00:17:52.200
Ye Qiu?

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:54.040
He came to us as undercover?

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:55.290
What's he up to?

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:57.620
I was wondering about the same thing.

00:17:57.620 --> 00:18:00.110
He's got the boss and the equipments.

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:01.700
I don't see him doing anything weird.

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:03.830
Or why don't we just confront him?

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:06.250
No, let's sit on it first.

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:08.870
See what he's up to.

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:11.910
It's not bad to have him work for us for free.

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:16.750
You are way better than the average.

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:19.000
I think you can be a Pro.

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:20.120
Definitely.

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:21.500
Just check out my name.
(Unrivaled Super Hottie)

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:21.810
(Unrivaled Super Hottie)

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:25.910
I bet you know who's behind us.

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:29.660
If you want to, I can introduce you to Team Tyranny.

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:32.160
The professional world?

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:34.790
I think it's more fun if I stay here.

00:18:36.910 --> 00:18:40.250
I'll tell you what, why don't you join us in Tyrannical Ambition?

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:41.800
Sure.

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:43.830
You can wander around the branches.

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:45.500
Go crack some dungeon records.

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:47.020
Way to go, president.

00:18:47.370 --> 00:18:49.160
Squeeze every single bit of that guy.

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:50.200
It's awesome.

00:18:50.200 --> 00:18:52.410
But, will it be too obvious to him?

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:54.500
Or he can just walk away.

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:56.160
We have nothing to lose.

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:04.410
(Chatting with Zhang Jiale)

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:06.160
You made a scene.

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:07.290
What you up to?

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:10.580
What you up to being in Tyrannical Ambition?

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:12.120
I'm trying to do my job.

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:13.700
You were quite cooperative last time.

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:14.870
You didn't blow my cover.

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:17.370
Do you want to work with us?

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:19.790
No, I just saw how hard you went for it.

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:20.790
Didn't want to get in your way.

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:22.500
Not hard at all.

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:23.650
I'm actually having fun.

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:25.100
What about you?

00:19:26.650 --> 00:19:27.480
Me?

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:29.840
I'm in the middle of a tough decision.

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:31.500
How tough can it be?

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:34.870
With me together, we will get the championship, no doubt.

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:35.930
Sorry.

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:37.790
You're not the decision I'm talking about.

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:39.870
You have no vision at all.

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:44.650
Vision takes time.

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:45.730
Do I have that?

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:48.110
I'm not like you.

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:51.930
I understand.

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:53.900
What did you understand?

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:58.910
What he means is, even if he does come back,
he doesn't have much time left as a Pro.

00:19:59.500 --> 00:20:02.660
If he aims at the championship,
he'll have to cherish all the time he has.

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:06.750
Joining a new team like ours
is simply an extravagant waste.

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:08.450
He said he's not like you.

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:10.040
What's the difference?

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:11.790
I had my share with the championship.

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:13.050
He didn't.

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:18.450
Too bad we couldn't get such a master.

00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:19.790
Yeah.

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:22.040
He gave up his chance to the championship.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:26.040
Good luck.

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:30.360
I should say the same thing to you just to be polite.

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:33.500
But if you got lucky, I'm afraid I'll be out of luck again.

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:35.270
Really don't know what to do.

00:20:36.220 --> 00:20:38.010
There's still a year before I come back.

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.120
Just take the year and make it count.

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:42.330
You better be back.

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:44.160
Well, good luck to you too, then.

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:45.530
Go for it.

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:47.850
Go for it.

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:54.290
Let's get back to business.

00:21:17.430 --> 00:21:20.560
♪ If you can't see the sky with your head up ♪

00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:25.680
♪ Then look down and focus on where you're heading ♪

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:30.520
♪ We all know that we don't want to bury our dreams ♪

00:21:30.520 --> 00:21:32.680
♪ Step back for the next take-off ♪

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:37.310
♪ All channels are reconnected ♪

00:21:37.640 --> 00:21:39.270
♪ I remember you said you would wait ♪

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:41.390
♪ Fine melody under my fingertips ♪

00:21:41.390 --> 00:21:43.560
♪ Perfect performance in digital world ♪

00:21:46.270 --> 00:21:48.270
♪ Brand-new melody, brand-new you and me ♪

00:21:48.310 --> 00:21:51.560
♪ Our passion will support us to the end ♪

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:54.810
♪ Light the fire in you ♪

00:21:54.810 --> 00:21:56.930
♪ Shine away the weakness in dark ♪

00:21:56.930 --> 00:21:58.640
♪ You can laugh at me, you can look down on me ♪

00:21:58.640 --> 00:22:00.430
♪ They would only drive me further ♪

00:22:00.560 --> 00:22:03.680
♪ Take record of our pulses ♪

00:22:05.810 --> 00:22:07.680
♪ All those provocations ♪

00:22:07.680 --> 00:22:09.850
♪ They will only firm my steps ♪
